OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with attempted murder
OL,4,Aafter cyclist hit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged in connection
OL,7,Fwith attempted murder after a car
OL,8,Fstruck a cyclist in Aberdeen.
OL,10,FEmergency crews were called to the
OL,11,Fscene near the junction of Rousay Drive
OL,12,Fand Lang Stracht, close to the Tesco
OL,13,Fsupermarket, after the 19-year-old
OL,14,Frider was hit by a white BMW car at
OL,15,Fabout 18:00 on Friday.
OL,17,FThe cyclist was taken to hospital for
OL,18,Ftreatment. A 37-year-old man was
OL,19,Farrested over the incident and has now
OL,20,Fbeen charged.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
